{"id":"6c59b8611811cc62","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-third-edition-cnf-conversion.md","title":"第三版完整条件下的 Chomsky 范式定理","display":"thm-third-edition-cnf-conversion — 第三版完整条件下的 Chomsky 范式定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-third-edition-cnf-conversion","aliases":["73-thm-third-edition-cnf-conversion"],"display":"thm-third-edition-cnf-conversion — 第三版完整条件下的 Chomsky 范式定理","depends_on":["[[73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf]]","[[73-thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination]]","[[73-thm-book-cnf-conversion]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.1.5, Theorem 7.16, print pp. 272–275; PDF pp. 294–297","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-third-edition-cnf-conversion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-third-edition-cnf-conversion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-third-edition-cnf-conversion — 第三版完整条件下的 Chomsky 范式定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8fdba87feab50061\" href=\"?note=8fdba87feab50061\" title=\"73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf\">73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b91495e20376554\" href=\"?note=0b91495e20376554\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination\">73-thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90e260b881deee8a\" href=\"?note=90e260b881deee8a\" title=\"73-thm-book-cnf-conversion\">73-thm-book-cnf-conversion</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1.5, Theorem 7.16, print pp. 272–275; PDF pp. 294–297"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\">\\(G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(G)\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(L(G)\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。转换后的字母表允许删除无用终结符，因此明确量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma&#39;\\subseteq\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma&#39;\\subseteq\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\Sigma&#39;\\subseteq\\Sigma\\;\\exists H\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma&#39;}\\;\n[\\operatorname{BookCNF}(H)\\land L(H)=L(G)\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\Sigma&#39;\\subseteq\\Sigma\\;\\exists H\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma&#39;}\\;\n[\\operatorname{BookCNF}(H)\\land L(H)=L(G)\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依次去空规则、单位规则、无用符号，再终结符替换及二叉化。删除无用符号可能同时缩小终结字母表；不能在保持含多余字符的固定 Σ 的同时声称“每个终结符都有效用”。非空非 ε 假设保证开始符号仍有效用。空语言仍有 CNF₀ 形状的文法，但不满足这条完整 BookCNF 条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"8fdba87feab50061","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"0b91495e20376554","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-book-cnf-conversion","status":"resolved","id":"90e260b881deee8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-book-cnf-conversion]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"L(G)\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma'\\subseteq\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\Sigma'\\subseteq\\Sigma\\;\\exists H\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma'}\\;\n[\\operatorname{BookCNF}(H)\\land L(H)=L(G)\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}].","display":true}],"bytes":1592,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-third-edition-cnf-conversion|第三版完整条件下的 Chomsky 范式定理]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["8fdba87feab50061","0b91495e20376554","90e260b881deee8a"]}